        DESCRIPTION "6 points, Init: Qik–16, Aquam R: Sight, D: Mom, T: Ind, Ritual The character forms a volume of water he sees into a water elemental. This has the same effect as the spell Rarefy the Crude Water (see Chapter 8: Magic Things, Elementals), but with Sight Range. CrAq 40 (Base: 25, +3 Sight): Ritual Power (x2) (40 levels, –2 cost)"
        REFERENCES {
            "Rarefy the Crude Water" -> #tN5VsbCy2BKz3hH7cgP9WIiu ^"Rarefy the Crude Water"
            "Ritual Power" -> #tdQ93Crvoc8wGzRCRqAYgMKe ^"Ritual Power"
        }
